 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How you get around",
     "texto": [
      "The means of transport is expressed with **mit** + dative: **mit dem Bus**, **mit dem Zug** (by train), **mit dem Auto** (by car), **mit dem Fahrrad** (by bike), **mit der U-Bahn** (by subway).",
      "«On foot» is **zu Fuß**.",
      "To travel **in a vehicle** you don't use «gehen» but **fahren**: **Ich fahre mit dem Bus**. «Gehen» is only for walking.",
      "**Fahren** changes its vowel: **ich fahre, du fährst, er fährt**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "At the station",
     "texto": [
      "**Eine Fahrkarte nach München** (a ticket to Munich). With cities, «to» is **nach**.",
      "**Einfach** = one way. **Hin und zurück** = return.",
      "**Wann fährt der Zug ab?** (when does the train leave?): the verb is **abfahren**, separable. It leaves from a **Gleis** (platform).",
      "**Wie lange dauert die Fahrt?** = how long does the journey take? **Ungefähr** = about."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
